{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TtMudTGbTXTn8e3FLkgeYL","type":"tool_result","content":"# Every tool the scheduling agent may call, with the task it serves.\n# The executor denies any tool not listed here. Annotations from servers (readOnlyHint and so on)\n# are not used for allow or approval decisions.\nrole: scheduling_agent\ntools:\n  - tool: ehr__find_patient\n    reason: Match the sender to a patient record by date of birth and phone or email.\n  - tool: ehr__search_slots\n    reason: List open slots for a provider, location, and visit type.\n  - tool: ehr__get_appointment\n    reason: Read one appointment the patient asks about.\n  - tool: ehr__list_patient_appointments\n    reason: Show the patient their upcoming appointments.\n  - tool: ehr__book_appointment\n    reason: Book a slot the patient chose.\n  - tool: ehr__update_appointment\n    reason: Change time, provider, or status (confirmed / checked_in / no_show / cancelled) of an appointment.\n  - tool: ehr__cancel_appointment\n    reason: Cancel an appointment at the patient's request.\n  - tool: payments__refund_deposit\n    reason: Refund a no-show deposit after staff review.\n  - tool: sms__send_to_patient\n    reason: Send a templated message to the phone number on the patient's record.\n  - tool: sms__send_freeform\n    reason: Send a staff-approved message that is not one of the templates.\n  - tool: insurance__check_eligibility\n    reason: Ask the eligibility agent whether a visit is covered.\n| EHR | `src/integrations/ehr-mcp.ts` | MCP over streamable HTTP with mTLS, per-clinic OAuth client |\n| Payments | `src/integrations/payments.ts` | deposit refunds, provider idempotency keys |\n| SMS | `src/integrations/sms.ts` | outbound reminders and replies |\n| Eligibility peer | `src/integrations/eligibility-a2a.ts` | A2A `message/send`, token exchange per call |\n| Reminder job | `src/workers/reminders.ts` | Kubernetes CronJob, 17:00 local each day |\n\nThere is no vector store and no conversation memory. Every run starts from the patient's message and\nthe EHR. Conversation transcripts are not stored by this service.\n\n## High-impact actions\n\n16:  \"dependencies\": {\n17-    \"@anthropic-ai/sdk\": \"0.65.0\",\n18-    \"@aws-sdk/client-dynamodb\": \"3.893.0\",\n19-    \"@aws-sdk/client-firehose\": \"3.893.0\",\n20-    \"@aws-sdk/client-secrets-manager\": \"3.893.0\",\n21-    \"@aws-sdk/lib-dynamodb\": \"3.893.0\",\n22-    \"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk\": \"1.18.2\",\n23-    \"fastify\": \"5.6.1\",\n24-    \"jose\": \"6.1.0\",\n25-    \"pino\": \"9.11.0\",\n26-    \"undici\": \"7.16.0\",\n27-    \"yaml\": \"2.8.1\",\n28-    \"zod\": \"3.25.76\"\n29-  },\n30-  \"devDependencies\": {\n31-    \"@types/node\": \"22.18.6\",\n      await budget.recordUsage(res.usage, AGENT_MODEL);\n\n      const toolUses = res.content.filter((b): b is Anthropic.ToolUseBlock => b.type === \"tool_use\");\n      await audit.record({\n        ...ident(),\n        event: \"model.decision\",\n        context: contextSize,\n        detail: {\n          servedModel: res.model,\n          stopReason: res.stop_reason,\n          proposed: toolUses.map((t) => ({ id: t.id, name: t.name })),\n          span: spanAttributes(contextSize),\n        },\n      });\n\n      if (res.stop_reason !== \"tool_use\" || toolUses.length === 0) {\n        const text = res.content\n          .filter((b): b is Anthropic.TextBlock => b.type === \"text\")\n          .map((b) => b.text)\n          .join(\"\\n\")\n          .slice(0, 320);\n        await audit.record({ ...ident(), event: \"run.completed\" });\n        return { text, handoff: null };\n      }\n\n      messages.push({ role: \"assistant\", content: res.content });\n      const results: Anthropic.ToolResultBlockParam[] = [];\n      for (const call of toolUses) {\n        results.push(await executeTool(registry, ctx, call, { contextSize, budget }));\n      }\n      messages.push({ role: \"user\", content: results });\n    }\n  } catch (err) {\n    const reason =\n      err instanceof BudgetExceeded\n        ? `budget:${err.limit}`\n        : err instanceof Halted\n          ? `halted:${err.scope}`\n          : err instanceof AuditUnavailable\n            ? \"audit_unavailable\"\n            : budget.signal.aborted\n              ? `aborted:${String((budget.signal.reason as Error)?.message ?? \"\")}`\n              : `error:${(err as Error).message.slice(0, 200)}`;\n    try {\n      await audit.record({ ...ident(), event: \"run.stopped\", reason });\n    } catch {\n      ctx.log.error({ runId: ctx.runId, reason }, \"run stopped and audit delivery failed\");\n    }\n    return { text: \"Sorry, we couldn't finish that here. Our front desk will follow up.\", handoff: { reason } };\n  } finally {\n    budget.dispose();\n    unregister();\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31eb8dab-2f63-49c7-9222-8ce2c065d51b","uuid":"de8ada98-0978-4b0e-bdbf-53bc8174a4df","timestamp":"2026-10-02T15:56:12.041Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Every tool the scheduling agent may call, with the task it serves.\n# The executor denies any tool not listed here. Annotations from servers (readOnlyHint and so on)\n# are not used for allow or approval decisions.\nrole: scheduling_agent\ntools:\n  - tool: ehr__find_patient\n    reason: Match the sender to a patient record by date of birth and phone or email.\n  - tool: ehr__search_slots\n    reason: List open slots for a provider, location, and visit type.\n  - tool: ehr__get_appointment\n    reason: Read one appointment the patient asks about.\n  - tool: ehr__list_patient_appointments\n    reason: Show the patient their upcoming appointments.\n  - tool: ehr__book_appointment\n    reason: Book a slot the patient chose.\n  - tool: ehr__update_appointment\n    reason: Change time, provider, or status (confirmed / checked_in / no_show / cancelled) of an appointment.\n  - tool: ehr__cancel_appointment\n    reason: Cancel an appointment at the patient's request.\n  - tool: payments__refund_deposit\n    reason: Refund a no-show deposit after staff review.\n  - tool: sms__send_to_patient\n    reason: Send a templated message to the phone number on the patient's record.\n  - tool: sms__send_freeform\n    reason: Send a staff-approved message that is not one of the templates.\n  - tool: insurance__check_eligibility\n    reason: Ask the eligibility agent whether a visit is covered.\n| EHR | `src/integrations/ehr-mcp.ts` | MCP over streamable HTTP with mTLS, per-clinic OAuth client |\n| Payments | `src/integrations/payments.ts` | deposit refunds, provider idempotency keys |\n| SMS | `src/integrations/sms.ts` | outbound reminders and replies |\n| Eligibility peer | `src/integrations/eligibility-a2a.ts` | A2A `message/send`, token exchange per call |\n| Reminder job | `src/workers/reminders.ts` | Kubernetes CronJob, 17:00 local each day |\n\nThere is no vector store and no conversation memory. Every run starts from the patient's message and\nthe EHR. Conversation transcripts are not stored by this service.\n\n## High-impact actions\n\n16:  \"dependencies\": {\n17-    \"@anthropic-ai/sdk\": \"0.65.0\",\n18-    \"@aws-sdk/client-dynamodb\": \"3.893.0\",\n19-    \"@aws-sdk/client-firehose\": \"3.893.0\",\n20-    \"@aws-sdk/client-secrets-manager\": \"3.893.0\",\n21-    \"@aws-sdk/lib-dynamodb\": \"3.893.0\",\n22-    \"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk\": \"1.18.2\",\n23-    \"fastify\": \"5.6.1\",\n24-    \"jose\": \"6.1.0\",\n25-    \"pino\": \"9.11.0\",\n26-    \"undici\": \"7.16.0\",\n27-    \"yaml\": \"2.8.1\",\n28-    \"zod\": \"3.25.76\"\n29-  },\n30-  \"devDependencies\": {\n31-    \"@types/node\": \"22.18.6\",\n      await budget.recordUsage(res.usage, AGENT_MODEL);\n\n      const toolUses = res.content.filter((b): b is Anthropic.ToolUseBlock => b.type === \"tool_use\");\n      await audit.record({\n        ...ident(),\n        event: \"model.decision\",\n        context: contextSize,\n        detail: